Geant4 @VERSION@

Geant4 is distributed under the Geant4 Software License, which is reproduced
in @PREFIX@/share/Geant4/LICENSE in this installation.  See
https://geant4.web.cern.ch/license/ for the terms.

This Debian package is not produced by the Geant4 Collaboration.  It packages
a local build so that Geant4 installs and configures the same way on Linux,
macOS and Windows.  The packaging scripts are part of Strata and carry
Strata's licence.

The data files the installer downloads are covered by their own terms, stated
in the README of each dataset.
